{"date": "2020-03-08", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0308.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:03+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "c6b88199b12cba6b1f6a852b133f6e99fc3a56dc633a913d961f13fd96e163d3", "image_bytes": 169183, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 02 Mar 2020 13:14:20 GMT", "title": "宜赞美", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "流浪北京", "author": "吴文光", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "她很敏感，也很有勇气，她不像一般的女人那么脆弱，但她也有那种女性温柔的心理。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2020-03-09", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0309.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:03+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "15ea3d56d7670d9b6ee4a557179c7874685f8e2785556e29daa74274961c1697", "image_bytes": 182223, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 02 Mar 2020 13:14:21 GMT", "title": "忌画饼", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "扭曲的人性之材", "author": "以赛亚-伯林", "author_roles": ["哲学家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "一个无限遥远的目标，就不是目标了，只是•⋯一个欺骗；目标应该是离得比较近的，起码应该像是工人的工资，或者是劳动时的快乐。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "author_foreign_name": "ISAIAH BERLIN"}
{"date": "2020-03-10", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0310.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:04+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "94377fdd0595b0799d4d00a8930fba00deeb3d2108f2cf52d6a3c014cdcfff34", "image_bytes": 160018, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 11:47:18 GMT", "title": "忌一蹶不振", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "青春咖啡馆", "author": "帕特里克·莫迪亚诺", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我在严酷的环境中长大。要么往前走，要么一命呜呼。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "PATRICK MODIANO"}
{"date": "2020-03-11", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0311.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:04+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "bb470db4c978885c96988d4e8ed1f57e98c391f17ffafbc7c442f690c29eb5ee", "image_bytes": 186233, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 19:18:23 GMT", "title": "忌隔阂", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "基列家书", "author": "玛丽莲·罗宾逊", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "你对某个东西可能熟悉得不能再熟悉，而实际上又一无所知。一个人可以熟悉自己的父亲或者儿子，可是他们之间除了忠诚、爱和相互不理解，什么都不存在。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "MARILYNNE ROBINSON", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "bb470db4c978885c96988d4e8ed1f57e98c391f17ffafbc7c442f690c29eb5ee", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}, "metadata_edits": [{"audit": "author_names_2026-11-03", "changes": {"author_foreign_name": {"before": "MARILYNNE ROBINYSON", "after": "MARILYNNE ROBINSON"}}, "evidence_image_sha256": "bb470db4c978885c96988d4e8ed1f57e98c391f17ffafbc7c442f690c29eb5ee"}]}
{"date": "2020-03-12", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0312.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:04+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "3594cfb38d2049629a0a62a181380ecd305df37ab17f23edd28f25c31f20ebc5", "image_bytes": 170407, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 20:35:31 GMT", "title": "宜迎春", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "人间草", "author": "汪曾祺", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "二月里刮春风。立春后，要刮四十八天“摆条风”。风摆动树的枝条、树醒了、忙忙地把汁液送到全身。树枝软了。树绿了。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2020-03-13", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0313.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:04+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "f9cd056f1fa36206865e9738b22c8bea1001fdd165dc51b1f8178983f8d39bcc", "image_bytes": 165871, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 20:35:31 GMT", "title": "忌裹挟", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "曼德施塔姆夫人回忆录", "author": "娜杰日达-曼德施塔姆", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "时代会用两个指头夹起一个人，从他身上挤出时代所需的那一滴善恶来。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
{"date": "2020-03-14", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0314.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:05+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "8b67d92ecdebb9716b43b09a4a5b0e3a44522d88f8d26a815a9757804234c3ac", "image_bytes": 150191, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 20:35:32 GMT", "title": "宜漫步", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "无主之作", "author": "多纳斯马尔克", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "—你不是想和我聊天吗？—其实我想和你散步。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "DONNERSMARCK"}
{"date": "2020-03-15", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0315.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:05+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "408ac2b7c674494891b5f6e825c715902485c95b2f810843bebdf2f51ce19659", "image_bytes": 202964, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 20:35:33 GMT", "title": "宜酒神精神", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "不可能性", "author": "乔治·巴塔耶", "author_roles": ["哲学家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "那些醉醺醺的时刻，我们无视一切，我们起锚、快乐地驶向深渊，既不顾忌不可避免的坠落，也不顾忌开始就给定的界限，只有在那些时刻，我们才完全摆脱了大地⋯", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "author_foreign_name": "GEORGES BATAILLE"}
{"date": "2020-03-16", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0316.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:05+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "64cb0660dbf1ddf036a3405f6378458509f01162a2c4f72ed4fdb5fe881a3977", "image_bytes": 181140, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 09 Mar 2020 20:35:34 GMT", "title": "忌没心没肺", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "事实", "author": "菲利普·罗斯", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我最不想做的事，就是送给文学读者一个笑容。我想证明，生活是悲痛伤感的，哪怕自己正感受着生活的振奋人心。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "PHILIP ROTH", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "64cb0660dbf1ddf036a3405f6378458509f01162a2c4f72ed4fdb5fe881a3977", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}}
{"date": "2020-03-17", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0317.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:05+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "fdcb37b60883087248c5cf536cea4c416bdebc6edd6b06e4846c6142746cbe87", "image_bytes": 166155, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 16 Mar 2020 13:00:18 GMT", "title": "忌六神无主", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "春天的故事", "author": "埃里克·侯麦", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我没有再期盼什么人或什么事，我只是静静地等着时间流逝，等到黑夜结束，太阳就会升起来。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "ERIC ROHMER", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "fdcb37b60883087248c5cf536cea4c416bdebc6edd6b06e4846c6142746cbe87", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}}
{"date": "2020-03-18", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0318.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:06+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "54f5a3d278a88567057045e230dc94559be1e4a749dd37a45b6e1ef5b227d35c", "image_bytes": 162785, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 16 Mar 2020 18:59:34 GMT", "title": "宜随心所欲", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "音乐即自由", "author": "坂本龙一", "author_roles": ["音乐家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "仔细想想，白己积极开始的事情应该不多，真的是消极的人生。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "RYUICHI SAKAMOTO"}
{"date": "2020-03-19", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0319.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:06+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "5be83659c35ce9c2435824c6eef65bf2f68ae276d891a0f2a8a45d1ff3672c10", "image_bytes": 212465, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Tue, 17 Mar 2020 00:36:38 GMT", "title": "忌迷失", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "双城记", "author": "查尔斯·狄更斯", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "那是最美好的时代，那是最糟糕的时代；那是智慧的年头，那是愚昧的年头；那是信仰的时期，那是怀疑的时期；那是光明的季节，那是黑暗的季节；那是希望的春天，那是失望的冬天；我们全都直奔天堂，我们全都在直奔相反的方向。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "CHARLES DICKENS"}
{"date": "2020-03-20", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0320.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:06+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "87fcb3e22327450c34933498d266df84e6f8c7f47f291483bcb3458c0acb7398", "image_bytes": 178619, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Tue, 17 Mar 2020 00:36:38 GMT", "title": "忌大男子主义", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "小妇人", "author": "路易莎·梅·奥尔科特", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "我不喜欢受人恩赐，这样压迫我，让人感到像个奴隶。我宁愿一切事情都由自己做，完全独立。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "ALCOTT, LOUISA MAY", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "87fcb3e22327450c34933498d266df84e6f8c7f47f291483bcb3458c0acb7398", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}, "metadata_edits": [{"audit": "author_names_2026-11-03", "changes": {"author_foreign_name": {"before": "LOUISA MAY", "after": "ALCOTT, LOUISA MAY"}}, "evidence_image_sha256": "87fcb3e22327450c34933498d266df84e6f8c7f47f291483bcb3458c0acb7398"}]}
{"date": "2020-03-21", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0321.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:06+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "af0bb70f62bebcbb4259fc05f69ad1dd3df5ed831afc0e11a5d3821bee4eb361", "image_bytes": 163012, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Wed, 18 Mar 2020 08:18:17 GMT", "title": "宜相伴", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "迷魂记", "author": "阿尔弗雷德·希区柯克", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "—你不认我们两个志趣相投的人各自游荡是种浪费吗？—独自一人才算游荡，两个人总会有个目的。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "ALFRED HITCHCOCK"}
